# Python (fundexpert)

- CLI strings are Turkish; code, identifiers, and API fields are English.
- Call `ensure_utf8_stdio()` before any CLI render on Windows.
- Turkish case: do not use `str.upper()` on fund names. Apply i↔İ / ı↔I then `.upper()` (see `select/strategy.py`).
- Strategy and sector buckets come from `fundexpert/rules.json` name keywords, not `umbrella_type`.
- Founder (`kurucu`) is attributed from official title prefixes; TEFAS and BEFAS lists stay separate. Filter founders before scoring.
- Bundle writes go only through `validate_bundle` then `publish_bundle`. Never silently fall back to cached candidates if the active bundle is missing or invalid.
- TEFAS web export is undocumented: one request per view/universe, fail closed on schema/access drift. Do not add Playwright WAF bypasses.
- Tunables live in `fundexpert/config.py`. Weights are 5% units, ≥5% floor, sum 100.
- After a feature: `vulture fundexpert/` and `./scripts/refresh-docs.ps1` if architecture changed.
- If tests fail, stop other work and fix tests first (`./scripts/check.ps1`).
